    "en": {
      "trackName": "Zumfruit: Watch Marble Game",
      "description": "Experience the most addictive marble shooter ever designed specifically for Apple Watch. Zumfruit brings the classic Zuma gameplay to your wrist with a modern twist.\nDesigned for Watch: This isn't just a port. Every level and animation is optimized for the small screen to ensure a fluid, high-definition experience.\nDigital Crown Control: Forget clunky touch controls. Use the Digital Crown to rotate your launcher with surgical precision and tap the screen to fire. It is intuitive, responsive, and incredibly satisfying.\nInstant Fun: Perfect for commuting, waiting in line, or quick breaks. No phone required.\nMaster the chain, unlock power-ups, and clear the board. Your wrist has never been this entertained.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/zumfruit-watch-marble-game/id6761325137?uo=4",
